        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lesion appears hyperechoic, which is characteristic of a simple breast cyst, and the posterior acoustic enhancement observed is consistent with this finding.",
        "label": "BENIGN",
        "label_int": 0,
        "expert_id": "expert_a",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c2",
        "uuid": "3bfcacc7-f888-4d8a-b46c-c44d44746a5c",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lesion is oval in shape, which is a common shape for simple cysts.",
        "label": "BENIGN",
        "label_int": 0,
        "expert_id": "expert_a",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c3",
        "uuid": "9e999706-e245-483d-b364-d55905140833",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The lesion has parallel orientation, which is suggestive of a benign nature.",
        "label": "BENIGN",
        "label_int": 0,
        "expert_id": "expert_a",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c4",
        "uuid": "7a6d83b1-5f9f-4611-8c60-6bf319a626e3",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "There are no calcifications or posterior shadowing observed, which further supports the benign interpretation.",
        "label": "BENIGN",
        "label_int": 0,
        "expert_id": "expert_a",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c5",
        "uuid": "b553ca03-43da-4dab-928b-e176d533be23",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The observed hyperechoic nature of the lesion is consistent with a simple breast cyst, but the presence of posterior shadowing is not supportive of this benign interpretation. Posterior shadowing can also be associated with malignant lesions, such as solid breast masses.",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c6",
        "uuid": "fb12b63e-4b4b-4fb5-bca1-9f42e0478fa3",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The irregular shape of the lesion, which is not oval as suggested in claim c2, suggests a malignancy. Irregular margins are indicative of a malignant mass finding.",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c7",
        "uuid": "b41dcec8-4162-48bc-80d9-95557660c2be",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The orientation of the lesion is not parallel, which contradicts the claim that it is suggestive of a benign nature in c3. Non-parallel orientation is more characteristic of malignant masses.",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 0
      },
      {
        "node_id": "c8",
        "uuid": "c82b5ca2-df97-4c66-97cf-2ad7651800cf",
        "type": "claim",
        "text": "The hyperechoic nature of the lesion is not exclusive to simple breast cysts, as posterior shadowing can be associated with both simple and complex cysts and solid breast masses. The posterior shadowing observed here is more indicative of a malignant lesion, such as a solid breast mass, rather than a simple cyst.",
        "label": "MALIGNANT",
        "label_int": 1,
        "expert_id": "expert_b",
        "round_idx": 1
      },
      {
